[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Safeer from power-on
Name[sl]=Safeer od vklopa
Comment=Safeer from power-on to the desktop: the Safeer boot and login screen and, if Safeer Cinnamon is not on yet, the Safeer workspace after login; asks for the administrator password
Comment[sl]=Safeer od vklopa do namizja: zagonski in prijavni zaslon Safeer in, če Safeer Cinnamon še ni vklopljen, po prijavi delovna površina Safeer; vpraša za skrbniško geslo
Exec=safeer-cinnamon --od-vklopa
Icon=preferences-desktop-theme
Categories=Settings;DesktopSettings;
